# Plan: Create 4 Banking Dashboard Pages

## Context
The user wants 4 React page files rewritten with COMPLETE, production-quality implementations. The existing files are outdated/stub implementations that don't match the user's requirements. The existing codebase uses:
- `useAuth` from `hooks/useAuth.ts` with `login(LoginRequest)`, `register(RegisterRequest)`, `{ user, isAuthenticated }`
- `formatCurrency` from `utils/format.ts` returning full `$1,000,000` format
- Services: `dashboardService.getDashboardSummary()`, `dashboardService.getDashboardAnalytics()`, `authService.getAllUsers()`, `userService.delete(id)` (no `authService.deleteUser`)
- Common components: `StatusBadge`, `ConfirmDialog`, `LoadingSpinner`, `EmptyState` from `components/common/`
- `User` type has `fullName: string`, `roles: Role[]` (not firstName/lastName)
- `DashboardSummary` has `projectStatusDistribution: Record<string, number>` (not array)
- `AnalyticsResponse` has `portfolioPerformance`, `recentUpdates`, `riskDistribution`, etc.

## Files to Create (all at `src/pages/`)

### 1. `LoginPage.tsx`
- Complete rewrite with login + register toggle
- Dark blue gradient background, centered white card
- Banking icon (Building2 from lucide-react) + title
- Login form: username, password fields
- Register form: username, email, password, firstName, lastName
- Loading states, error display, demo credentials
- Uses `useAuth().login({ username, password })` and `useAuth().register({ username, email, password, firstName, lastName })`
- Navigate to `/dashboard` on success

### 2. `DashboardPage.tsx`
- Complete rewrite with Tailwind CSS (not inline styles)
- 8 KPI cards in responsive grid (grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4)
- Each KPI card with icon, label, value, colored background accent
- Charts section: PieChart (status, health), BarChart (budget vs actual, priority)
- Recent Updates section
- Fetches from `dashboardService.getDashboardSummary()` + `dashboardService.getDashboardAnalytics()`
- Loading skeleton state, error handling

### 3. `ProfilePage.tsx`
- Complete rewrite using `useAuth().user`
- Large avatar with initials
- User info: username, email, fullName, roles (as badges), account info
- Uses `getInitials`, `formatDate`, role badges with colors

### 4. `AdminUsersPage.tsx`
- Complete rewrite with standalone data table (no external DataTable component)
- Fetches users via `authService.getAllUsers()`
- Delete via `userService.delete(id)` with ConfirmDialog
- Table columns: Username, Email, Full Name, Role(s), Status, Created
- Role badges, delete button, loading/empty states
- Guard: checks for ADMIN role

## Key Decisions
- Use Tailwind CSS classes throughout (user requested it)
- Import `formatCurrency` and `formatDate` from `../utils/format` (user's specified import)
- Import `useAuth` from `../hooks/useAuth` (user's specified import)
- Use `userService` for delete since `authService.deleteUser` doesn't exist
- DashboardSummary has `Record<string, number>` distributions, need to convert to chart data format `[{ name, value }]`
- No new dependencies needed — all available: lucide-react, recharts, react-hot-toast

## Verification
- All files import from correct relative paths
- All types match `types/index.ts` definitions
- All service methods exist in the codebase
- Lint and typecheck after creation (if available)
